# tests/ is TRACKED. This was previously `tests/*` plus a hand-maintained
# allowlist of 36 individual files, which meant a new test was invisible to git
# by default. 21 of the 57 test files on disk were ignored - including
# atomic-writes, frontmatter, promote, tracking, indexstore, bm25-store,
# graph-metrics-cache, cli-learning-wiring and health-learning, i.e. exactly the
# tests that prove the correctness fixes in this release. `tests/fixtures/` was
# ignored too, so the 36 allowlisted tests could not run from a clean clone.
#
# Deny-by-default on a test directory fails silently and in the worst direction:
# the suite still passes locally, so nothing tells you the evidence never shipped.
.npmrc

# Registry tokens (sensitive)
.mcpregistry_github_token
.mcpregistry_registry_token
mcp-publisher.exe

